            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Codex Whip is now one universal app for Apple silicon and Intel Macs, with its engine rewritten in Swift. It starts faster and no longer unpacks a Python runtime each time it opens.

New: About Codex Whip in the menu. Turning on Whip Sound plays the crack once.

Automatic Updates is on by default. If it was turned off without you choosing it, this update turns it back on once.

Your settings, pending retries and Activity history carry over unchanged.
]]></description>
